## Data Privacy & Security

- No PII in Storybook fixtures, screenshots committed to repo, or analytics event payloads.
- No secrets in UI code or Storybook; use env vars.
- Do not commit licensed font/image assets without rights documented in `{HANDOFF_UI}`.

